# Pinned rootfs toolchain — cloud/deploy/rootfs (Task 3, spec §6 research).
# Every value is consumed by build.sh as a docker build-arg; the Dockerfile
# verifies node (nodejs.org SHASUMS256.txt) and uv (GitHub release .sha256)
# checksums inline and fails the build on any mismatch.
# UBUNTU_IMAGE: pulled by build.sh, which resolves and records its RepoDigest
#               into manifest.json at build time (not pinned here).
# NODE_VERSION: official nodejs.org tarball — NEVER apt node (research §6).
# PNPM_VERSION: corepack prepare + activate (store v10 mechanics, research §5).
# UV_VERSION:   GitHub release tarball, sha256 verified against the release
#               checksums file.
UBUNTU_IMAGE=ubuntu:24.04
NODE_VERSION=v22.20.0
PNPM_VERSION=10.34.0
UV_VERSION=0.13.1
APT_PACKAGES="ca-certificates curl git openssh-client procps python3 python3-venv xz-utils"
